    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait really?? that sounds super scary. i've had cramps like this before when i'm just sitting too long and it's usually fine after some stretching and water. are you sure it's not just a muscle strain from the cramped seats? i really don't want to deal with an ER visit right now if i can help it, it's so expensive and i'm just so tired.",
